    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZalithLauncher/ZalithLauncher2/zipball/2.5.1",
    "body": "## Updates:\r\n- #0e1b12d: Integrated JSound into LWJGL (by @ShirosakiMio)\r\n\r\n## Changes:\r\n- #1797: Limit joystick resize via drag handle to the size allowed by properties (by @youfeng11)\r\n- #1799: Increased polling sample rate for joystick in controller mapping mode, and normalized offsets by actual interval (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Fixes:\r\n- #1789: CurseForge downloads failing (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1793: Window size oscillation in picture-in-picture/split-screen mode causing severe screen flickering (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1793: Control layout not functioning properly when window size changes (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1794: Keep-alive foreground service startup timeout causing game process crash (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1795: Single click on hotbar slot triggering the switch key twice (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1798: ENOENT error when saving control layout due to external storage issues (by @MovTery)",
